title: Video Chat with Boris Mann, Fission

Boris Mann kindly invited me to one of [[Fission|https://fission.codes]]'s regular video chats. I was rather hoping to talk more about Fission's work, but we ended up focussed more on the history of TiddlyWiki, where it is now, and where it may be going.

